    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One named delivery (mood or manner of speaking) of a voice. What each field does depends on the TTS family; a field the voice&apos;s model cannot use is rejected with InvalidVoiceProfile (3023) when the voice is set. A mode with no fields set behaves like the built-in &quot;neutral&quot; mode, so every profile can define the same names and game code stays portable across models. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
